  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Lu Wei Yin grunts. This is the third killer move. A huge maze completely envelops Fang Yuan. It extends in all directions, like the core of a hollow mountain. Interweaving paths and walls are complex and confusing, and people would feel dizzy just looking at them. Fang Yuan’s sense of direction dwindles. He cannot tell where is up, down, left, or right. Moving alongside the walls, he forgets the path he came from. Attacks that land on the walls become extremely weak, because those walls have the effect of descending sand.",
